<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada to auction C$2.5 bln 6-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada to auction C$2.5 bln 6-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada plans to auction C$2.5 billion of six-day treasury bills on October 28, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on October 29 and will mature on November 4, the Bank of Canada said.</p>
<p>The tender is subject to standard auction terms.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
